ng.", "OL"]}, {"n": 27, "text": ["THE EMPTY HOLE", "Power: Economic Crash: All players lose 50% of", "their points.", "R[2] A[0] F[2]", "Lore: Where is the gold? Ask the fish. The first", "major liquidity crisis in German history."], "page": 8, "quad": 2}, {"page": 8, "quad": 3, "text": ["OFTSHURL", "BANKING!", "OATH OF SILENCE", "Power: Omerta: You cannot be forced to reveal", "your hand.", "R[5] A[5] F[5]", "Lore: As long as one of us lives, the gold", "remains hidden. Spite is a powerful glue.", "GW", "Georg v. Westphalen"], "n": 28}, {"text": ["ETZEL (THE OX)", "MAIL", "ORDER", "BRIDE?", "Power: Horde Command: Summon 3 'Hun' tokens", "(1/1/1) to fight for you.", "R[4] A[6] F[4]", "Lore: Attila, Mighty King. Scourge of God. Doesn't", "realize he's just a weapon in his new wife's purse."], "quad": 0, "page": 9, "n": 29}, {"n": 30, "text": ["THE INVITATION", "the Party!", "Come", "Power: Force an opponent to move their pieces", "to a 'Trap' location.", "R[1] A[1] F[6]", "Lore: Come for the solstice. Stay for the massacre.", "Hagen knew it was a trap, but honor is stupid."], "quad": 1, "page": 9}, {"page": 9, "n": 31, "text": ["THE JOURNEY EAST", "Power: Point of No Return: Once played, you", "cannot retreat. Fight or die.", "R[2] A[2] F[2]", "Lore: They crossed the Danube and smashed the", "boat. One way ticket to hell."], "quad": 2}, {"n": 32, "page": 9, "quad": 3, "text": ["LONU", "GAME!", "THE PROPHECY (MERMAIDS)", "Power: Spoiler Alert: Look at the top 3 cards", "of the deck. Keep the worst one.", "R[O] A[0] F[5]", "Lore: Only the chaplain returns alive.", "Everyone else is meat. Hagen tried to drown", "GW", "Georg v. Westphalen", "the chaplain to prove them wrong. He failed."]}, {"n": 33, "page": 10, "text": ["THE BANQUET TABLE", "RED", "WEDDING", "VIBES!", "Power: Tension: No attacks this turn,", "R[o]", "but double damage next turn.", "A[o]", "Lore: Eat with your heloet on. Drini", "with your left hand. Don't mention", "F[o]", "the gold."], "quad": 0}, {"pag