 bodies", "down the", "R[2]", "stairs.", "Cleaning", "A[2]", "service is", "going to quit.", "F[2]", "GW", "Georg v. Westphalen"], "n": 40, "quad": 3, "page": 11}, {"n": 41, "page": 12, "quad": 0, "text": ["DIETRICH VON BERN (THE LION)", "BOSS", "FIGHT!", "R[6]", "Power: The Reluctant Hero: Starts passive. If", "attacked, destroys the attacker instantly.", "А[6]", "Lore: He didn't want to fight. But then you killed", "F[6]", "all his friends. Now the Lion is awake."]}, {"page": 12, "quad": 1, "text": ["HILDEBRAND (THE OLD WOLF)", "R[5]", "Power: Veteran Instinct: Reroll any failed die.", "A[5]", "Lore: Master of arms. Too old for this nonsense,", "F[4]", "but too loyal to leave."], "n": 42}, {"quad": 2, "text": ["RÜDIGER (THE DOG)", "сot de", "Ghht L nes", "Vakrol", "Crearae i51", "olletiaina", "Did Tee", "Power: Moral Conflict: Choose: Fight and die, or", "R[4]", "Refuse and die.", "A[4]", "Lore: The tragic hero. Forced to fight his friends", "F[2]", "because he promised a woman a favor. Be careful", "what you promise."], "n": 43, "page": 12}, {"n": 44, "page": 12, "quad": 3, "text": ["THE DUNGEON", "FINISH", "HIM!", "R[O]", "Power: Capture: The game ends for these characters.", "Move to execution phase.", "A[O]", "Lore: Captured by Dietrich. Tied up. The fighting is", "F[5]", "GW", "over. The suffering begins.", "Georg v. Westphalen"]}, {"quad": 0, "page": 13, "text": ["_cut here", "GUNTHER'S HEAD", "GAME", "OVER", "MAN!", "Power: Proof: Discard this card to force Hagen", "R[O]", "to speak. (Spoiler: He won't).", "A[O]", "Lore: She cut off her brother's head to make a", "F[0]", "point. The point being: She has lost her mind.", "cut here"], "n": 45}, {"text": ["cut here", "BALMUNG RECLAIMED", "HEADS", "WILL", "ROLL!", "Pover: Execution: Kill a defenseless prisoner.", "R[6]", "Gain no Honor.", "A[6]", "Lore: She took the sword from Hagen. The sword her |", "F[0]", "huaband owned. Poetic justice, written in blood.", "I cut here"], "page": 13, "n": 46, "quad": 1}, {"q